📝 A simple web application to manage a to-do list with task addition, deletion, and local storage.

🚀 Features

  ✅ Add a task.
  ❌ Delete a task.
  📂 Local storage for data persistence.
  🌍 Import a task list via a JSON URL.

🛠 Technologies Used

    HTML, CSS, JavaScript
    LocalStorage to save tasks
    Fetch API to load tasks from an external URL

📌 Usage

1️⃣ Add a task
    Type a task and click "Add" or press Enter.

2️⃣ Delete a task
    Click the "REMOVE" button next to the task.

3️⃣ Import tasks
    Enter a JSON URL containing a task list and click "Load".

4️⃣ Clear the list
    Click "Clear" to delete all tasks.

